        "text": "**Initiating Speech-to-Text Setup**\n\nI'm starting on the Python files for the speech-to-text task. My first task is `speech_client.py`, which will house the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text client. I'm focusing on setting up the core connectivity and authentication components now.\n\n\n**Expanding Project Scope**\n\nI've expanded the scope and am now planning out ten files. I'm moving on to `submit_transcription.py`, which is going to use the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text client. I've begun outlining the steps to make a batch transcription submission. I'll need to define the request and response models, potentially in `speech_models.py`, which I'll create soon. Right now, I will start to implement `speech_client.py`.\n\n\n",
